XLED_GPU 5V 5V 5V 5V 5V 5V 5V 5V 5V 5V K_GPU_10 K_GPU_9 K_GPU_8 K_GPU_7 K_GPU_6 K_GPU_5 K_GPU_4 K_GPU_3 K_GPU_2 K_GPU_1 OSX10201_GYR1
VS_GPU_1 K_GPU_1 K_GPU_1_SINK 0
VS_GPU_2 K_GPU_2 K_GPU_2_SINK 0
